---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="min-h-screen md:h-screen w-full flex flex-col justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4 sm:py-6 md:py-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="w-full flex justify-between items-center">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-sm">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">ChatPDF</span>
      </div>

      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200/60">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>Sin registro · Acceso libre</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="my-auto py-3 md:py-2 flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Pill / Eyebrow -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50/80 text-blue-800 border border-blue-200/50 mb-4 sm:mb-5">
        <span class="text-blue-600">✦</span>
        <span>Investigá, estudiá y consultá sin barreras</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.12] mb-4">
        Preguntale a tus PDFs <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-slate-700 to-slate-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          sin vueltas ni registros.
        </span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Value Proposition / Context -->
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
        Entrás, subís tu archivo y empezás a hacer preguntas de inmediato. Sin crear una cuenta, sin pantallas de configuración previa y sin suministrar ningún dato personal.
      </p>

      <!-- Three Pillars -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 w-full mb-6 sm:mb-8 text-left">
        <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-white/90">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-0.5">Sin inicio de sesión</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-normal">Cero formularios, correos o contraseñas.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-white/90">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-0.5">Cero datos requeridos</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-normal">Privacidad garantizada. Nada que configurar.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-white/90">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-0.5">Directo al estudio</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-normal">Subí el documento y preguntá al instante.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Button -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <a
          href="/chat"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-3.5 text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 active:scale-[0.99] rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-slate-900/20 transition-all duration-200 group"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12" />
          </svg>
          <span>Subir PDF</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal">
          Sin instalación ni configuraciones · Listo para usar
        </p>
      </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="w-full py-2 text-center text-xs text-slate-400 font-light">
      ChatPDF — La forma más rápida y privada de consultar tus documentos.
    </footer>

  </div>
</Layout>
